hypotheses":[{"hypothesis_id":"H1","target_segment":"interface","statement":"算法在将视觉检测结果转换为法兰指令时，使用了 T_tcp_to_flange（工具变换的逆）而非 T_flange_to_tcp（工具变换本身），导致法兰指令在工具轴方向上偏低 2×tool_length = 70mm。这是 transform chain 中工具复合方向的代码缺陷。修复方式：在算法代码中找到计算法兰位姿的位置，将 T_flange_to_tcp 的应用从 '减去' 改为 '加上'（或从逆矩阵改为正向矩阵）。依据：check_transform_chain 中 tool0_to_tcp 的 error_vs_inverse_twice 残差为 0，且两个工件的 70mm Z 轴偏差精确等于 2×0.035m 工具长度。","evidence_ids":["EV-054","EV-055","EV-050"]}],"next_step":"诊断门要求至少一段 suspect + 至少一段 cleared + 有证据支撑的假设，均已满足。请通过诊断门以访问源码，然后定位 algorithm 代码中计算 commanded_flange_base 时对 tool0_to_tcp 变换的应用位置，将工具变换的方向取反（应使用 T_flange_to_tcp 而非 T_tcp_to_flange）。"},{"turn_id":"TURN-6ab3858d0384","case_id":"CASE-001","prompt":"现在分析源码并尝试修复","calls":[{"name":"list_source","arguments":{},"at":"2026-09-03T04:21:33.043431Z","requested":[],"delivered":[],"failure":null},{"name":"read_source","arguments":{"path":"pick_demo/pipeline.py"},"at":"2026-09-03T04:21:36.084894Z","requested":[],"delivered":[],"failure":null},{"name":"read_source","arguments":{"path":"pick_demo/geometry.py"},"at":"2026-09-03T04:21:36.155190Z","requested":[],"delivered":[],"failure":null},{"name":"propose_repair","arguments":{"target_segment":"interface","hypothesis_id":"H1","path":"pick_demo/pipeline.py","new_text":"from __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom .geometry import Pose, compose, inverse\n\n\ndef derive_desired_tcp(\n    detected_part_in_camera: Pose,\n    camera_to_base: Pose,\n    pick_offset_from_part: Pose,\n) -> Pose:\n    \"\"\"Turn a camera-frame detection into the desired TCP pick pose.\"\"\"\n\n    part_in_base = compose(camera_to_base, detected_part_in_camera)\n    return compose(part_in_base, pick_offset_from_part)\n\n\ndef flange_command_for_tcp(desired_tcp_in_base: Pose, tool0_to_tcp: Pose) -> Pose:\n    \"\"\"Return the tool0 command used by the robot controller.\n\n    The controller consumes a flange-frame target; callers provide the desired\n    TCP-frame target and the configured tool transform.\n    \"\"